<footer class="site-footer">
  <div>
    <div>
    <p>
      Load and EV profiles are derived from Steidl, Zabala Figueroa et al., "High-resolution residential energy load profiles under varying electrification scenarios for NZ and Germany using resLoadSIM", Zenodo v1, 8 May 2025, <code>https://zenodo.org/records/15362256</code> (linked below), licensed CC BY 4.0. The data are synthetic and NZ-parameterised. Aggregated to 30 minutes and scaled; changes were made by the author.
    </p>
    <p>Feeder layout (hero drawing): IEEE PES European LV Test Feeder, simplified redraw from the bus coordinates; no licence stated; not an IEEE figure.</p>
    <p>This is a simulation study, v0.9. The code is MIT licensed; the data keep their own terms. Data sources are on the method page:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={`${base}/method/`}>Method and checks</a></li>
    </ul>
    </div>
